Mackey, on the other hand, said they have a group dinner planned for Saturday night, where they&#x2019;ll officially meet for the first time. &#x201C;It&#x2019;s thrilling, my absolute dream," she said.

Does Mackey plan to ask Swinton for any advice? &#x201C;I mean, what would I… She's the queen. I wouldn&#x2019;t even know how to breathe around her, I don&#x2019;t think. So step by step.&#x201D;

As for her role on the jury, Mackey said: "I'm just so happy to be here."

"I love that it&#x2019;s a festival that honors first and second time filmmakers. I think it&#x2019;s very smart," she continued. "You know how hard it is to make a movie and get them financed and how miraculous it is to get everything aligned, so I&#x2019;m very hopeful and I&#x2019;m happy to be a part of that.&#x201D;

